          "start": 1189
        },
        "quote": "(g) Any sign that does not conform to the regulation of the sight distance triangle in TMC 12.20.020 or any clear zone as defined by the American Association of State Highway and Transportation Officials.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.040:block:9#text",
